\n\"You must kill a certain person within one hour. If you don't, your soul will be destroyed.\"\n\nTo pull off the absurd task assigned to him, he poured all his available points to the Stealth skill tree. This is a story of a boy who specialized in Stealth. With his skill trees as weapons, he would demonstrate his unrivaled strength in another world.\n\n(Source: Shousetsuka ni Narou, translated)","cover":"/api/proxy/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.readdetectiveconan.com%2Ffile%2Fmangapill%2Fi%2F5742.jpeg","image":"/api/proxy/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.readdetectiveconan.com%2Ffile%2Fmangapill%2Fi%2F5742.jpeg"},"type":"manga","format":"Manga & Manhwa","source":"Mangapill"}